      "q": "How much does Thundercat Technology make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Thundercat Technology obligated $172M in federal contracts in FY2027 to date. Thundercat Technology received 109 awards this fiscal year with an average award size of $1.6M. Obligations fell 85.3% year over year. Historical annual obligations were $1.2B in FY26, $916M in FY25, $807M in FY24, $854M in FY23, and $680M in FY22."
